	REF91=<ATTACKER.LAST>
	DTEXT +0 +60 0 Son saldıran
	DTEXT +200 +60 <DEF.NOTO.<REF91.NOTOGETFLAG <UID>>> <QVAL (<REF91.ISVALIDE>)?<REF91.NAME> [<ATTACKER.LAST.DAM> Hasar]:Yok>
	
